# bad_tilt.sm -- A hole along z through a flange tilted by 0.001 degree
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# Fuzzer finding: a tilt of up to 0.0026 degree passed as square, and the
# hole went square to the slab instead of along its axis.
sheet 1 1 0.4
plate p 0 0 50 40 origin 0 0 0 axes +x +y
flange f p +x 0.001 30
hole 4 70 20 along z
